        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVYi43R4N5Xm1Jf6f2FzyypsHyKJydyy8mzEBMDXhjvIdboElnh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "The owner is so kind! The employees are so kind! Great place to get a tan. 100% recommend",
        "time": 1767549932,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "The Diamond Crew",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110542222708714349189/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjURSDqPN_NiGARijKwILstwMEUVPbh_W6-Fx19XS_6g5iSOZcUg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Super friendly staff this is a new name so new administrators and the beds are super high end the bulbs are very strong and efficient I really felt a huge difference with just 8min I like that the machines have separate lights for the face only they are running a promo for 75 min at 85$ decided to buy a package and not have to worry about always paying\n\nBeds are great clean and everything was super quick and amazing\n\nPlace is super cute decor and I realized only after that they can keep your tanning creams for you so you don't have to carry it all the time\n\nTotally worth it check it out if you're a tanaholic like me hihi\n\nCheers",
        "time": 1678901576,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tifa Jackson-Somerville",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113826776881288881202/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7zeSq4NY28PpzbUh7R40KTE7ggpQVqcbr-JoNn8BboKZju7ya=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "All the girls working here are so nice. If you're new to tanning, they'll happily explain and answer any questions you have.\nThe place is clean and the decor is cute.",
        "time": 1748122032,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Donna Devine",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112028822939878008334/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLNzrhUuBKjG8sVQANAt6e_Qh2QLHGZ_usoydUYKjhcO7hKdA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "I recently visited Bronzage Midi Soleil and tried their new RED LIGHT THERAPY! As someone who suffers from major arthritis in my back, I was amazed by the results after just three sessions . This is far superior to the invasive and costly cortisone shots I used to get every few months . Tara and her team are knowledgeable and made me feel comfortable from the minute I walked in the door , taking the time to explain the different benefits of the different coloured lights . I am thrilled with the results ( no more daily Tylenol Arthritis )  and cannot wait for them to introduce the RED LIGHT THERAPY MASK next !",
        "time": 1746702559,
        "translated": false
      }
